# PART 10 — MORNING EXPERIENCE & USER JOURNEY
==================================================

The complete user journey should be organized around a typical morning.

STAGE 1 — NIGHT BEFORE

The user:
- Configures the alarm.
- Reviews tomorrow's agenda.
- Sets the planned departure time.
- Checks tomorrow's essential belongings.

STAGE 2 — WAKE UP

The alarm activates at the configured time.

The user completes the selected wake-up challenge.

STAGE 3 — PLAN THE DAY

The user opens MORNIN.

The Home screen displays:
- Current time.
- Today's overview.
- Remaining tasks.
- Time to leave.

The user reviews My Day.

STAGE 4 — BREAKFAST

The user views a breakfast recommendation.

The user marks breakfast as completed after eating.

STAGE 5 — GET READY

The user checks their belongings.

The checklist updates dynamically.

STAGE 6 — READY TO GO

MORNIN displays:

"You're all set."

"Have a wonderful day!"

The morning session is completed.

